{"text":"正光三年九月九日，公孫合妻公孫迴姬為亡父母、前□□□造無量壽佛一區。願長命老壽，恆侍佛因緣。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"公孫迴姬","refId":null,"text":"公孫迴姬","start":13,"end":17},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"無量壽","refId":null,"text":"無量壽","start":27,"end":30},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"因緣","refId":null,"text":"因緣","start":43,"end":45}]}